### Users API

#### **GET** /api/v1/users

Retrieve a paginated list of users.

**Query Parameters:**

| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |
|-----------|------|---------|-------------|
| page | integer | 1 | Page number |
| limit | integer | 20 | Items per page |
| sort | string | "created_at" | Sort field |
| order | string | "desc" | Sort order |

**Response:** 200 OK

${'```'}json
{
